### Getting mailing list details [GET /lists/{MailingListID}/details.{Format}{?apikey}{?WithStatistics}]
Gets details for a given mailing list. You may include subscriber statistics in your results or not. Any segments existing for the requested mailing list will not be included in the results.

+ Parameters
    + Format: json (required, string)

        + Members
            + json
            + xml
        
    + MailingListID: `a589366a-1a34-4965-ac50-f1299fe5979e` (required, string)
    The ID of the mailing list to be returned.
    + apikey: `bafe55f4-e53e-4651-8164-c6d6ff05081b` (required, string)
    You may find your API Key or generate a new one in your account settings.
    + WithStatistics: true (optional, string)
    Specifies whether to fetch statistics for the subscribers or not. If omitted, results will be returned with statistics by default.
    
        + Members
            + true
            + false
   

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    
    
    + `Code` : The response code for this call. This will be 0 if successful.
    + `Error` : The response error message. This will be null if successful.
    + `Context` : This contains all the following information for the requested mailing list:
    + `ID` : The id of the requested mailing list.
    + `Name` : The name of the requested mailing list.
    + `ActiveMemberCount` : The number of the active members for the requested mailing list.
    + `BouncedMemberCount` : The number of the bounced emails for the requested mailing list.
    + `RemovedMemberCount` : The number of the removed emails for the requested mailing list.
    + `UnsubscribedMemberCount` : The number of the unsubscribed emails for the requested mailing list.
    + `Status` : The status of the requested mailing list. 
        - `0` is for created.
        - `1` is for imported. 
        - `2` is for importing. 
        - `3` is for deleted.

    + `CustomFieldsDefinition` : The details of each custom field for the requested mailing list. This will be blank if there are no custom fields for this mailing list.
        - `ID` : The id of the custom field
        - `Name` : The name of the custom field
        - `Context` : The context of the custom field. Will be null if not singleSelectDropDown.
        - `IsRequired` : False if the custom field is not required, true if it is
        - `Type` : 0 for text, 1 for number, 2 for dateTime, 3 for singleSelectDropDown, 5 for checkbox.
    
    + `CreatedBy` : The ip from where the requested mailing list was created.
    + `CreatedOn` : The date time that the requested mailing list was created.
    + `UpdatedBy` : The ip from where the requested mailing list was updated.
    + `UpdatedOn` : The date time that the requested mailing list was updated.
    + `ImportOperation` : The details of the latest import operation that was performed in the requested mailing list.
         - `ID` : The id of the import operation.
         - `DataHash` : A guid id for the import operation.
         - `Mappings` : The mappings that where used for the specific import operation (Email, Name etc).
         - `EmailNotify` : Null if the import operation notification email was not selected to be sent.
         - `CreatedOn` : The date time that the import operation was created.
         - `StartedOn` : The date time that the import operation started.
         - `CompletedOn` : The date time that the import operation was completed.
         - `TotalInserted` : The number of the total inserted emails.
         - `TotalUpdated` : The number of the total emails that where updated.
         - `TotalUnsubscribed` : The number of the total emails that where unsubscribed.
         - `TotalInvalid` : The number of the total invalid emails.
         - `TotalIgnored` : The number of the total ignored emails.
         - `TotalDuplicate` : The number of the total duplicate emails.
         - `TotalMembers` : The number of the total members that where selected to be imported.
         - `Message` : The message of the import operation. This will be null if successful.
         - `Success` : This will be true if successful.
         - `SkipNewMembers` : This will be false if the skip new members option was not selected before the import operation began.
 

    + Body
    
            {
              "Code": 0,
              "Error": null,
              "Context": {
                "ID": "28132257-f655-49a4-8af7-6fbf31645641",
                "Name": "test auto",
                "ActiveMemberCount": 19999,
                "BouncedMemberCount": 0,
                "RemovedMemberCount": 0,
                "UnsubscribedMemberCount": 0,
                "Status": 1,
                "CustomFieldsDefinition": [
                  {
                    "ID": "c3226cc-8a18-4f22-907b-8422d61a53a1",
                    "Name": "Gender",
                    "Context": "<items><item><name>Male</name><value>Male</value></item><item><name>Female</name><value>Female</value></item></items>",
                    "IsRequired": true,
                    "Type": 3
                  },
                  {
