                     },
                     {  
                        "Context":"https://twitter.com/myCompany",
                        "ContextName":null,
                        "TotalCount":89,
                        "UniqueCount":89,
                        "ContextDescription":null
                     }
                  ]
               }
            }
        
        
## Sending Campaigns [/campaigns/{CampaignID}/schedule.{Format}{?apikey}]

### Scheduling A Campaign [POST /campaigns/{CampaignID}/schedule.{Format}{?apikey}]
Assigns a scheduled date and time at which the campaign will be delivered.

+ Parameters
    + Format: json (required, string)
    
         + Members
            + json
            + xml
            
    + apikey: `13cffeee-0b8c-4610-8e0d-efa7bd44be32` (required, string)
    You may find your API Key or generate a new one in your account settings.
    + CampaignID: `afdc4ef6-999f-4d74-905b-ec234789f9d6` (required, string)
    The ID of the campaign to be scheduled


+ Request (application/json)


    + `DateTime` : The date and time at which the campaign will be delivered. ***(Required)***
    + `Timezone` : The timezone the specified date and time refers to. By default the timezone in your settings panel will be used. If specified, one of the following values must be used. ***(Optional)***
