### Deleting A Segment [DELETE /lists/{MailingListID}/segments/{SegmentID}/delete.{Format}{?apikey}]
Deletes a segment along with its criteria from the mailing list. The subscribers of the mailing list that the segment returned are not deleted or affected in any way.

+ Parameters
    + Format: json (required, string)
    
         + Members
            + json
            + xml
            
    + MailingListID: `a589366a-1a34-4965-ac50-f1299fe5979e` (required, string)
    The ID of the mailing list the specified segment belongs.
    + apikey: `13cffeee-0b8c-4610-8e0d-efa7bd44be32` (required, string)
    You may find your API Key or generate a new one in your account settings.
    + SegmentID: 10199 (required, string)
    The ID of the segment to update.

        
+ Response 200 (application/json)
        
        
    + `Code` : The response code for this call. This will be 0 if successful.
    + `Error` : The response error for this call. This will be null if successful.
    + `Context` : The response context for this call. This will be null if successful.

   
    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json

    + Body
    
            {
              "Code": 0,
              "Error": null,
              "Context": null
            }
         



